# Walking directions on the walker screen, against the FAKE cloud (docs/subsystems/navigation.md). The
# position is the SIMULATED one and the maps are the recorded responses, as in navigation.walk.
# Run (from devices/pi): node dist/walker.mjs simulate --screen --script test/sim/navigation-screen.walk
# and open the printed http://127.0.0.1:8740/ at 800x480 to watch.

expect spoke Sophi is on.
expect link online
expect screen ambient

# A route starts: the screen shows it once the Pi has said its first line's place.
fake tool start_route Lake Merritt Boating Center
key t
expect screen listening
wait 1200
key t
expect navigation guiding
expect spoke Walking to the Lake Merritt Boating Center
expect 20000 screen navigating
wait 3000

# "Stop the directions": Talk takes the screen while she asks, then the clock once the route has ended.
fake tool stop_route
key t
expect screen listening
wait 1200
key t
expect spoke Fake cloud: Stopped the directions to the Lake Merritt Boating Center.
expect navigation none
expect 30000 screen ambient

key q
